coding different isoforms. [provided by RefSeq, Feb 2016].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q9NNW5","text":"Together with methyltransferase FTSJ1, methylates the 2'-O-ribose of nucleotides at position 34 of the tRNA anticodon loop of substrate tRNAs (PubMed:32558197, PubMed:33771871). Required for the correct positioning of the substrate tRNA for methylation (PubMed:32558197). Required to suppress amino acid starvation-induced autophagy (PubMed:22354037). Enhances the STK11/LKB1-induced cell growth suppression activity (PubMed:17216128)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}